{"id":"d63c357151e48e9d","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-proof-system.md","title":"Proof System","display":"df-proof-system — Proof System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-proof-system","aliases":["58-df-proof-system"],"display":"df-proof-system — Proof System","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md]]","[[../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-system — Proof System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"752f7efeb30c6175\" href=\"?note=752f7efeb30c6175\" title=\"../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md\">../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6748c30f3a00f99a\" href=\"?note=6748c30f3a00f99a\" title=\"../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md\">../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules},\\mathcal P\\in V\\land\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules},\\mathcal P\\in V\\land\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}_\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}_\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"752f7efeb30c6175\" href=\"?note=752f7efeb30c6175\" title=\"../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md\">../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(-,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(-,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6748c30f3a00f99a\" href=\"?note=6748c30f3a00f99a\" title=\"../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md\">../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\in V\\)</span> (normalized rules defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,R\\in V\">\\(F,R\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,F)\">\\(\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,F)\\)</span> 的第二参数为公式载集，正文给出它在任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 上的完整定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,F)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(F^k\\times F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,F)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(F^k\\times F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\;(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\;(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\operatorname{RuleOn}_S(R,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}mp} \\vdash \\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MP}_\\Sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}mp} \\vdash \\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MP}_\\Sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}gen} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\psi\\rangle:\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\langle\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,x\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}gen} \\vdash \\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\psi\\rangle:\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\langle\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,x\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}hilbert} \\vdash \\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Gamma,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Ax})\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\{\\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\}\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system\\text{-}hilbert} \\vdash \\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Gamma,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Ax})\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\{\\mathrm{MP}^{\\sharp}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Gen}^{\\sharp}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\}\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rules are normalized as pairs consisting of a finite premise sequence and one conclusion.</li>\n<li>The generalization rule depends on the active assumption set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> through its free-variable side condition; it cannot be a single context-free tag.</li>\n<li>Concrete proof objects are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a>, provability in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"582b96e73e5d1c6e\" href=\"?note=582b96e73e5d1c6e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-provable.md\">../batch08/58-df-provable.md</a>, and arithmetized provability in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a>.</li>\n<li>Normalization now projects the registered MP and generalization rule sets themselves; it no longer silently redefines their side conditions in a second place.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md","status":"resolved","id":"752f7efeb30c6175","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-ax-modus-ponens.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md","status":"resolved","id":"6748c30f3a00f99a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-ax-generalization.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules